    <string name="pref_desktop_components_summary">During install, also fetch Xvfb + Openbox + xterm + capture tools via the distro package manager (~25 MB one time on Alpine, ~60 MB on Debian/Ubuntu). Disable on slow connections; the terminal works either way.</string>
    <string name="pref_desktop_components_title">Install desktop components</string>
    <string name="pref_distro_select_summary">Distro to install/run (Alpine, Debian or Ubuntu). They coexist on disk; the selected one is active. Changing this shows an Install prompt — nothing downloads without your tap.</string>
